The folder contains scripts for packaging and installing the Wi-Fi Alliance's
Certification Test Suite's Linux DUT controller software to DUT and a script to
start / stop the DUT controller remotely.

Usage (under Wi-FiTestSuite-Linux-DUT repo):
* Package: deploy/package.sh $path_testing_rsa
* Install: deploy/install.sh $DUT_HOST
* Run:     deploy/wfa_ca_dut.sh start $DUT_HOST
* Stop:    deploy/wfa_ca_dut.sh stop $DUT_HOST

Note that the SSH identity file used to connect to the DUT is not included.
The file, testing_rsa, can be found in
https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/chromite/+/master/ssh_keys#
Please download it and provide it to package.sh.
